    'svc.number.overview':                           'Gapless, per-period invoice numbering is a legal requirement in the DACH market, and it is a race condition waiting to happen. Modules ask this service for the next number in a scope instead of each re-implementing a careful counter. Allocation is a single atomic transaction, so concurrent callers never receive a duplicate and never skip a value. A scope’s format renders the number from tokens — {seq}, zero-padded {seq:0000}, {YYYY}, {YY}, {MM}, {DD} — and its period restarts the counter each year, month or day, or never.',
    'svc.number.resp.0':                             'Independent counters per scope (invoice, order, offer, purchase order…)',
